    <string name="str_about_html"><![CDATA[
<h2>EEPROM Flasher</h2>
<p>Native Android tool for reading, writing, verifying, comparing and erasing EEPROM and Flash memories using TL866II+, TL866A, TL866CS, T48, T56 and T76 programmers via USB OTG without root.</p>
<hr/>
<b>Supported Programmers and Database:</b><br/>
• TL866II+: 29,774 devices (+47 custom)<br/>
• TL866A / TL866CS: 14,162 devices (+46 custom)<br/>
• XGecu T48: 29,739 devices<br/>
• XGecu T56: 32,513 devices<br/>
• XGecu T76: 34,607 devices<br/>
• Logic IC Tester: 283 ICs (+6 custom)<br/>
<br/>
<i>Note: The minipro engine does not support the CH341A or CH347 series.</i><br/>
<br/>
